<title>USA: Chase names Lee bank vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Chase names Lee bank vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp said on Tuesday it named James Lee Jr vice chairman of Chase Manhattan Bank, with responsibilities for global investment banking.</p>
<p>Among Lee's new duties are responsibility for U.S.-based wholesale client management.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
